隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/c7/c7d1ddf49fbf10f8dee3fa4370a36d7beb9587b472faa00a84eff2b211642a0a.wav","referenceText":"唉...又要去上兴趣班了...我想在家看动画片...不想去学钢琴..."},{"id":"real_emotion_06_14","displayName":"真人情绪·小北｜好奇提问","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/01/01538fa60a3945407a619770d665765b8a9d283342d9cbb1b5525403451b9a6f.wav","referenceText":"爸爸爸爸，为什么恐龙会灭绝呀？那它们还会回来吗？恐龙是怎么睡觉的？"},{"id":"real_emotion_06_15","displayName":"真人情绪·一一｜委屈辩解","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/79/79cda64cdd4db2eacd4ba54cfa29656647cfeee190b1c587ad0f9cd9fd1ce10d.wav","referenceText":"不是我打碎的...是小猫碰的...你们为什么都怪我...真的不是我..."},{"id":"real_emotion_06_16","displayName":"真人情绪·小辰｜认真专注","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d6/d664e43fa6d0f44604c07cf2a8e4851e98a243c16843ee226f828fdf5d3e5059.wav","referenceText":"别说话！我在搭积木呢！这是我的超级城堡，马上就好了！不要碰它！"},{"id":"real_emotion_06_17","displayName":"真人情绪·小安｜热情招呼","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/42/427765f685c63225ee323dcea0efa503c2d0f6c1a0461aa9ae9ae79f9541b9df.wav","referenceText":"快来快来！我发现了一个秘密基地！只有我们两个知道！快走！"},{"id":"real_emotion_06_18","displayName":"真人情绪·小航｜害羞腼腆","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/c3/c3500b8c8eae1205b536669d8128c03bf14ca4f0bccd589b296cde93dcfc79ee.wav","referenceText":"嗯...阿姨好...我...我叫小明...不要一直看我嘛..."},{"id":"real_emotion_06_19","displayName":"真人情绪·小朗｜期待盼望","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/03/03070804a4aafef41c8ac2b94839ae4f8265fda0c886bebf4cbab33c0493c15c.wav","referenceText":"还有几天到圣诞节呀？圣诞老人会给我送礼物吗？我想要一辆遥控车！"},{"id":"real_emotion_06_20","displayName":"真人情绪·小乐｜勇敢逞强","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/cc/cc5960c27001289e1d8b60fc8fa135208fed186cbcbdb8530b05829caffcd4da.wav","referenceText":"我才不怕呢！我是男子汉！打针一点都不疼！我才不会哭呢！"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd001","displayName":"明朗行动系·活泼·清快型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/74/74559b29b4fc8572c8429446151633450edb6ecbc7aed1824ab86b0478b0f070.wav","referenceText":"今天的风轻轻吹过来，树叶也跟着不停摇动。大家已经准备好了，新的发现正在前面。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd002","displayName":"明朗行动系·活泼·跳脱型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/80/80e30a72db1a2e022901a48168f653ea93e597f480c9f2a86f189b5bee3a482b.wav","referenceText":"大家很快就要回来了，现在正适合一起出发。别站在这里一直犹豫，路上的事情边走边说。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd003","displayName":"明朗行动系·活泼·亲近型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/f1/f12ba7b964d67ab2a294bf7970bbd30f908fce221bda4687e3e450750d1f6e7b.wav","referenceText":"今天的风轻轻吹过来，新的事情正在等着我们。先看看前面的方向，我们现在一起出发。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd004","displayName":"明朗行动系·机灵·聪慧型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/19/19da1abd1865bdf9e080b02fc63f60d15f70ed53ab20545671c1b6dc53fd3fcf.wav","referenceText":"大家很快就要回来了，树叶也跟着不停摇动。先不要告诉其他人，合适的时候再揭开。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd005","displayName":"明朗行动系·机灵·小滑头型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-