oting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/62/62b75649795dcf89322751eac56a60d97cca5939d0ad6aeb47accbb64c131741.wav","referenceText":"屋里的灯轻轻亮着，我会把东西好好收起。这个办法听起来确实有用，我们可以一起去看看。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd018","displayName":"温和亲和系·呆萌·憨萌型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/56/5668db4cca22d04d7542ccd48f9c08bedcd52e6c710cf22914380f224af2c4e8.wav","referenceText":"大家很快就会回来，这里让人觉得很安心。我想先认真试一遍，我们可以一起去看看。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd019","displayName":"灵巧机变系·顽劣·淘气型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/dd/dd5696593a9812ddb54492333f5a3afca530f0d16483e51f150d1e233f29c2ff.wav","referenceText":"门外暂时没有动静，真正的答案还没有出现。我刚刚想到一个新办法，合适的时候再揭开。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd020","displayName":"灵巧机变系·顽劣·恶作剧型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/8c/8c38d75b5f643b36a0205c5ac0a3ae1db15dc3a8b4919d51c565e19bf037ffcf.wav","referenceText":"我刚才发现一个细节，我想再悄悄看上一眼。我刚刚想到一个新办法，合适的时候再揭开。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd021","displayName":"灵巧机变系·顽劣·野孩子型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a6/a609c0952f774e5769a5684d7960a4c038f57b555900c59e43fba46dc0a138f3.wav","referenceText":"门外暂时没有动静，真正的答案还没有出现。我刚刚想到一个新办法，说不定会有新发现。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd022","displayName":"灵巧机变系·古灵精怪·鬼点子型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/b0/b0628e8d179f32260e2295ec0eb711b3358d706a4e4126b69d9eab143faaf36c.wav","referenceText":"事情看着好像很简单，说不定正藏着新线索。再看看那个小小的细节，我们可以换个方向试试。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd023","displayName":"灵巧机变系·古灵精怪·灵动型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/fe/febbd3da037413360911f26bd051506c7e47ca8c75f3832283d6553b87ffbc60.wav","referenceText":"门外暂时没有动静，说不定正藏着新线索。事情也许比想象中好玩，我们可以换个方向试试。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd024","displayName":"灵巧机变系·古灵精怪·小狐狸型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a6/a6a0380ab636f3a2716738967ce941b66c67449492dea63efcabbb5323fc5caf.wav","referenceText":"大家还没注意到那里，说不定正藏着新线索。我刚刚想到一个新办法，答案可能藏在前面。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd025","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·怯生型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/c4/c4ea9e76731f7bff4f55842b9fec798406c9d2ce6eac4450a5bd855d51800709.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，心里还有一点不安。请让我先在这里等一会儿，我一直都在认真听着。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd026","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·依赖型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d7/d7d4f633dd6c903a4bcb074b1e70f009927e5fe44bb613591df5c75dad9ef9a2.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，我会努力把话说清楚。我不太习惯面对这么多人，需要的时候我会开口。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd027","displayName":"内收脆弱系·胆小·惊弓型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/85/85f1fd563c4472d3e749e76b1c5448327ad8741093e369e8208bc3d764d95d19.wav","referenceText":"屋里的灯还亮着，我想先在这里等一会儿。我不太习惯面对这么多人，我会努力说明白。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd028","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·娇怯型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/33/3396dd7069760d9749355225c6079b27a7be381fc007fa1d2565db74e6228e77.wav","referenceText":"风从窗边轻轻经过，我想先在这里等一会儿。心里的害怕还没有散去，这阵害怕很快就会过去。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd029","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·委屈型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/fd/fd5f2e649720ef37583d814874965e118ce52285a9155b139f1042342a3da895.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，现在还需要慢慢习惯。我知道自己看起来很脆弱，我其实没有真的放弃。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd030","displayName":"内收脆弱系·哭包·依赖型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/22/22718169df7eb4b9e0477602ed0638566c07df5264048bf820f9e783c5b48714.wav","referenceText":"屋里的灯还亮着，现在还需要慢慢习惯。请让我先在这里等一会儿，我一直都在认真听着。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd031","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·虚弱型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/3f/3f52f198860097b083ccf249127cb84d4e25d65308b1b4172c2140c1f861dd0f.wav","referenceText":"我已经把东西收好了，我想先在这里等一会儿。不用一直在旁边扶着我，稍作休息以后再继续。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd032","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·安静型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/a0/a0f2fb7e42383599b88522a7c191546f79eb5105d0e22b2cd70141135f0b4cab.wav","referenceText":"屋里的灯还亮着，现在还需要慢慢习惯。你不用一直看着这里，安静并不代表没有听见。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd033","displayName":"内收脆弱系·病弱·早慧型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/03/03e3506d5f5d46306e893b0cbbfa13350464056696ff333bed62a46b3b42332d.wav","referenceText":"风从窗边轻轻经过，我会努力把话说清楚。这件事情我已经想清楚，剩下的可以交给我。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd034","displayName":"端正可靠系·早熟·懂事型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/d2/d237d4a1b5b58e89aa666a2e627b5c9691e89b2a9e0b6aa5512b88544d84c52b.wav","referenceText":"刚才的安排我都记住了，等大家回来我会说明白。这件事情我已经想清楚，我知道下一步怎么做。"},{"id":"real_emotion_ad_mchd035","displayName":"端正可靠系·早熟·冷静型","locale":"克隆·男性儿童","gender":"male","audioUrl":"https://raw.github